    description: "Bakeoff finding (alertmanager, score 65.7): type_hierarchy linker broadcasts dispatches_to from every interface method to ALL implementors. 28 spurious edges in alertmanager (email/jira/discord all → discord.Notify). The Go analyzer already narrows for typed_receiver_call (local concrete vars), but misses interface-typed declarations with concrete RHS (var n Notifier = &SlackNotifier{}). Fix: either expand Go analyzer var_types to track concrete RHS through interface declarations, or add meta.concrete_receiver to call edges for the linker to consume."  # fa33
    fields: {}  # fa33
